(7497439, 1194557, 104230, '<td valign="top">Great action shot with a wonderful synchronicity of stride.  Meanwhile, in contrast, one athlete is looking immediately in front, possibly at the hurdle, while the other scans ahead.<br/> <br/>I wonder if you were tempted to crop a bit more off on the left?  I might have been tempted to do that even while recognizing that it would have cropped the writing on the nearest hurdle. <br/> <br/>Bumping.</td>', 'Great action shot with a wonderful synchronicity of stride.  Meanwhile, in contrast, one athlete is looking immediately in front, possibly at the hurdle, while the other scans ahead. I wonder if you were tempted to crop a bit more off on the left?  I might have been tempted to do that even while recognizing that it would have cropped the writing on the nearest hurdle.  Bumping.', '2017-02-07 17:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
