(7497500, 1194699, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely pastoral scene and I like the choice of sepia toning. The single tree provides a good visual anchor for the image and the mist/fog provides the right degree of contrast to be able to appreciate all the details in the tree. Finally I find the grouping of that trio of sheep very appealing!  Bump</td>', 'Lovely pastoral scene and I like the choice of sepia toning. The single tree provides a good visual anchor for the image and the mist/fog provides the right degree of contrast to be able to appreciate all the details in the tree. Finally I find the grouping of that trio of sheep very appealing!  Bump', '2017-02-07 20:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
