(7497769, 1194548, 63218, '<td valign="top">Well, most frequent score was a 5. I wonder what it is that would get your 6-&amp;-above vote? My honest reaction is the light is flat, the camera angle suggests the reason for the shot is to document the name &amp; number of the boat, &amp; the scene doesn''t hold my interest. Also the letterbox border makes me think the shot was cropped to fill the frame. It is a decent shot, as you say, but I''d vote a decent shot with a 5.</td>', 'Well, most frequent score was a 5. I wonder what it is that would get your 6-&-above vote? My honest reaction is the light is flat, the camera angle suggests the reason for the shot is to document the name & number of the boat, & the scene doesn''t hold my interest. Also the letterbox border makes me think the shot was cropped to fill the frame. It is a decent shot, as you say, but I''d vote a decent shot with a 5.', '2017-02-08 11:46:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7497772, 1194624, 124815, '<td valign="top">location?</td>', 'location?', '2017-02-08 12:06:16.000000', NULL, 0),
